\ ff-test: lines budget=100000
\ The watchdog budget covers the whole outermost evaluation.
\
\ Re-entering the interpreter (`evaluate`, `load`) used to restart the
\ opcode count and drop any pending ff_request_abort(), so a loop around
\ `evaluate` could never be stopped. The abort also now reports
\ FF_ERR_ABORTED, as documented, instead of a generic FF_ERR_BROKEN.

1 . cr
: spin begin again ;
spin
: respin begin "1 drop" evaluate drop again ;
respin
2 . cr
